WEBVTT

01:30.370 --> 01:34.930
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.280 --> 01:37.870
[Episode 33]

01:44.350 --> 01:45.610
Time-Reversal Array.

01:48.420 --> 01:49.530
What are you doing?

01:51.009 --> 01:52.410
With our combined power,

01:52.750 --> 01:54.550
we can send you back 10,000 years

01:54.820 --> 01:56.180
to see with your own eyes

01:56.200 --> 01:57.660
what really happened then

01:57.900 --> 01:59.430
and make your choice again.

02:00.900 --> 02:02.490
Stop this.

02:02.700 --> 02:04.920
Even if I choose 1,000 or 10,000 times,

02:04.950 --> 02:06.310
I would still choose Hong Ye.

02:06.310 --> 02:07.070
Sister,

02:08.840 --> 02:09.490
even if

02:10.060 --> 02:11.100
you don't like me,

02:12.030 --> 02:13.810
you absolutely cannot
make the wrong choice.

02:13.810 --> 02:14.600
Don't worry,

02:14.850 --> 02:16.370
with our three people's power,

02:16.370 --> 02:18.100
we can ensure your safe return.

02:18.650 --> 02:20.780
Once you understand the truth of the past,

02:20.780 --> 02:22.640
you will understand our actions.

02:23.460 --> 02:24.390
Absolutely not!

02:24.690 --> 02:26.730
The last time Xiao Yao
entered time reversal,

02:26.730 --> 02:27.570
even going back a mere 100 years

02:27.570 --> 02:28.900
was extremely dangerous,

02:28.900 --> 02:30.060
and she barely made it back.

02:30.060 --> 02:32.190
We cannot let her take this risk again.

02:37.020 --> 02:37.740
Hong Ye,

02:38.180 --> 02:40.300
if the three of us
joined forces to kill you,

02:40.300 --> 02:41.630
it would be effortless.

02:44.940 --> 02:46.870
But the truth from 10,000 years ago

02:47.620 --> 02:49.110
must not remain hidden.

02:49.850 --> 02:50.530
Xiao Yao,

02:51.180 --> 02:52.940
if you learn the truth of the past

02:52.940 --> 02:54.600
and still want to protect him,

02:54.900 --> 02:56.740
you can use the method
from 10,000 years ago

02:56.740 --> 02:58.020
to seal me again.

02:58.660 --> 03:00.300
I will respect your choice.

03:01.780 --> 03:03.130
We'll stake our lives

03:03.810 --> 03:05.200
to grant you clarity.

03:05.340 --> 03:06.130
Do you dare?

03:10.530 --> 03:11.460
How can I

03:12.740 --> 03:13.900
trust your words?

03:15.410 --> 03:15.970
Hong Ye!

03:30.829 --> 03:31.490
Teng She.

03:40.190 --> 03:40.940
Sister,

03:41.780 --> 03:42.620
I've always

03:43.020 --> 03:44.680
been the most obedient to you.

03:45.370 --> 03:46.740
Today, I'm begging you.

03:48.690 --> 03:50.290
Go back 10,000 years and see.

03:52.370 --> 03:53.940
I just made a blood oath.

03:54.650 --> 03:56.180
Heaven and earth bear witness.

03:56.180 --> 03:57.620
If there's even a hint of falsehood,

03:57.620 --> 03:59.550
if I have any intention to harm you,

03:59.810 --> 04:00.670
may I, Teng She,

04:02.220 --> 04:03.850
be utterly annihilated.

04:15.980 --> 04:17.470
Seeing your attitude,

04:18.130 --> 04:20.180
if we don't resolve these past grudges,

04:20.180 --> 04:21.420
you won't let this go.

04:27.160 --> 04:28.200
Since this is a personal grudge,

04:28.200 --> 04:29.260
I have a condition.

04:30.980 --> 04:31.660
Go ahead.

04:32.659 --> 04:33.860
Before I return,

04:34.250 --> 04:35.210
you must ensure

04:35.210 --> 04:37.370
Hong Ye and Demons' Valley remain safe.

04:37.370 --> 04:38.730
If humans attack,

04:38.860 --> 04:41.659
protecting Demons' Valley
must be your priority.

04:46.890 --> 04:47.450
Okay.

04:48.130 --> 04:48.659
Okay.

04:50.420 --> 04:50.940
Okay.

04:54.500 --> 04:55.300
In that case,

04:56.060 --> 04:57.520
I'll go seek a resolution.

04:58.210 --> 04:59.860
Otherwise, this constant trouble

04:59.860 --> 05:01.260
will never give us peace.

05:01.570 --> 05:03.430
I only ask that you return safely.

05:05.500 --> 05:06.230
Don't worry,

05:06.770 --> 05:09.500
I still want to eat
the noodles you make every day.

05:19.940 --> 05:20.500
Xiao Yao,

05:21.980 --> 05:23.240
no matter what you see,

05:24.540 --> 05:25.500
my love for you

05:27.210 --> 05:28.330
will never change.

06:34.060 --> 06:36.450
Xiao Yao, why did you come here?

06:37.060 --> 06:37.690
Go back.

06:37.940 --> 06:38.830
Go back now.

06:39.080 --> 06:41.340
What exactly happened
10,000 years ago?

06:41.810 --> 06:43.980
The truth is more than you can bear.

06:44.430 --> 06:46.460
You'll regret seeing it.

06:48.250 --> 06:49.460
If I'm powerless,

06:49.500 --> 06:50.700
I'll pray to the gods.

06:51.130 --> 06:52.100
If I'm powerful,

06:52.180 --> 06:53.909
I'll slay all demons in my path!

07:10.160 --> 07:15.510
[10,000 years ago]

07:16.860 --> 07:17.740
Where am I?

07:26.420 --> 07:27.540
Real gold.

07:29.450 --> 07:31.570
What was I 10,000 years ago?

07:34.210 --> 07:36.140
At least I was wealthy in this life.

07:37.500 --> 07:40.070
Xiao Yao, why have you gotten poorer?

07:44.300 --> 07:45.300
This...

07:53.450 --> 07:55.060
Looks quite impressive.

07:57.770 --> 07:59.810
I wonder what my power is like.

08:13.340 --> 08:14.300
I'm so powerful!

08:40.059 --> 08:40.850
Hong Ye?

08:42.809 --> 08:43.539
Hong Ye!

08:44.260 --> 08:45.520
What's wrong with you?

08:46.180 --> 08:46.580
You...

08:47.780 --> 08:49.300
Hong Ye, wake up.

08:50.810 --> 08:51.420
Hong Ye!

08:51.660 --> 08:52.260
Hong Ye!

08:55.610 --> 08:56.460
You're awake.

08:58.260 --> 08:58.850
Hong Ye.

09:02.180 --> 09:02.610
Demon.

09:03.690 --> 09:04.090
Demon.

09:04.730 --> 09:05.740
I'm Xiao Yao.

09:06.090 --> 09:06.780
Stay back.

09:07.330 --> 09:08.390
Don't come closer.

09:08.490 --> 09:09.180
Stay away!

09:19.060 --> 09:20.180
Why are you acting like this?

09:20.180 --> 09:21.580
I just saved your life.

09:22.810 --> 09:23.870
Listen carefully,

09:24.660 --> 09:25.970
I would rather die

09:25.970 --> 09:27.270
than surrender!

09:28.140 --> 09:30.060
If you want to eat a corpse,

09:30.540 --> 09:31.420
then come at me!

09:32.050 --> 09:32.570
Put the sword...

09:32.570 --> 09:33.060
Don't move!

09:33.060 --> 09:33.850
I won't move.

09:37.060 --> 09:38.520
Why would I want to eat you?

09:38.540 --> 09:39.870
Because you're a demon!

09:40.810 --> 09:42.540
We humans have been repeatedly

09:43.060 --> 09:45.780
enslaved and bullied by
you demons in this chaotic world.

09:45.780 --> 09:47.070
You've lost count of

09:47.660 --> 09:49.900
how many you've eaten yourself,
haven't you?

09:49.900 --> 09:51.810
How could everything have been reversed?

09:51.810 --> 09:53.320
If Hong Ye was human,

09:53.730 --> 09:55.530
how did he become the Demon King?

09:55.810 --> 09:56.890
And where did

09:57.020 --> 09:58.240
his power come from?

10:04.280 --> 10:05.570
I won't hurt you.

10:06.970 --> 10:07.540
If I wanted to eat you,

10:07.540 --> 10:09.140
I would have done so already.

10:11.020 --> 10:12.550
Did you really save me?

10:13.570 --> 10:14.020
Yes.

10:17.490 --> 10:18.550
If that's the case,

10:19.450 --> 10:20.570
may I leave now?

10:24.180 --> 10:24.730
Fine.

10:38.020 --> 10:38.580
Wait.

10:41.780 --> 10:43.220
Could you tell me

10:43.420 --> 10:44.730
your name

10:44.900 --> 10:45.960
and where you live?

10:46.780 --> 10:48.420
So you want to use me as bait

10:49.020 --> 10:50.300
to find more people.

10:52.260 --> 10:54.120
Why do you think of me as so wicked?

10:57.060 --> 10:57.780
Fine.

10:58.810 --> 10:59.610
Come closer,

11:01.060 --> 11:02.330
and I'll tell you.

11:21.660 --> 11:23.900
You just resemble someone I once knew,

11:24.120 --> 11:26.180
so I wanted to talk with you a bit more.

11:28.610 --> 11:30.270
I never intended to harm you.

11:40.430 --> 11:42.160
[Long Zhi]

11:46.740 --> 11:47.530
Hong Ye!

12:02.690 --> 12:03.490
Xiao Yao!

12:03.570 --> 12:04.660
-Dragon Lord.
-Dragon Lord.

12:04.660 --> 12:05.390
Dragon Lord.

12:07.060 --> 12:07.850
Xiao Yao.

12:09.920 --> 12:12.330
You've successfully
passed the tribulation.

12:12.330 --> 12:13.390
That's wonderful!

12:13.900 --> 12:15.180
You've attained the true form
of the Azure Dragon.

12:15.180 --> 12:18.850
From now on, our dragon clan shall
stand proudly among the universe.

12:18.850 --> 12:20.180
So Azure Dragons really do exist.

12:20.180 --> 12:20.900
Yes, indeed.

12:20.900 --> 12:21.430
Xiao Yao,

12:21.940 --> 12:24.020
you're truly a role model
for our dragon clan.

12:24.020 --> 12:24.690
Xiao Yao,

12:24.850 --> 12:26.090
that skill you just showed

12:26.090 --> 12:27.150
was truly amazing.

12:27.540 --> 12:28.140
Yes.

12:29.690 --> 12:30.570
Dragon clan?

12:31.690 --> 12:33.320
Then who are you?

12:36.690 --> 12:37.690
I'm Long Zhi.

12:38.610 --> 12:40.140
What are you talking about?

12:41.850 --> 12:43.540
My head hurts a bit.

12:44.060 --> 12:45.490
Apart from my name,

12:45.490 --> 12:47.290
I can't remember anything else.

12:47.690 --> 12:48.820
You don't remember?

12:51.300 --> 12:52.060
Well, some get injured, maimed,

12:52.060 --> 12:54.020
or even die
passing the heavenly tribulation,

12:54.020 --> 12:56.880
but this is the first time
I've heard of memory loss.

12:57.570 --> 12:59.430
Do you have any other discomfort?

13:00.380 --> 13:01.380
No, no.

13:03.690 --> 13:04.260
I see.

13:04.690 --> 13:06.570
The heavenly tribulation is perilous.

13:06.570 --> 13:07.540
Some mishaps

13:07.900 --> 13:08.830
are inevitable.

13:09.730 --> 13:10.940
After we finish our business,

13:10.940 --> 13:12.140
whatever you want to know,

13:12.140 --> 13:14.470
I'll tell you everything when we get back.

13:20.380 --> 13:22.610
Congratulations, Dragon Lord,
on overcoming your heavenly tribulation.

13:22.610 --> 13:24.180
attaining the true form of
the Azure Dragon,

13:24.180 --> 13:26.810
and achieving longevity
equal to heaven and earth.

13:26.810 --> 13:31.010
Congratulations, Dragon Lord,
on overcoming your heavenly tribulation!

13:38.900 --> 13:41.330
Each demon clan has its own leader.

13:41.660 --> 13:44.260
The dragon clan's cultivation
is the most arduous and lengthy,

13:44.260 --> 13:47.060
making true dragons
extremely rare and precious.

13:47.090 --> 13:48.350
The lowest are snakes.

13:48.610 --> 13:50.610
A snake cultivates for 100 years
to become a python,

13:50.610 --> 13:52.330
a python for 500 years
to become a serpent,

13:52.330 --> 13:54.180
a serpent for 500 years
to transform into a scaled dragon,

13:54.180 --> 13:56.940
and a scaled dragon needs 1,000 years
to become a true dragon.

13:56.940 --> 13:58.850
A dragon cultivates for 500 years
to become a horned dragon,

13:58.850 --> 14:00.570
and another 1,000 years
to become a winged dragon.

14:00.570 --> 14:03.260
The winged dragon was originally
the highest rank in the dragon clan.

14:03.260 --> 14:04.780
But since you're exceptionally talented,

14:04.780 --> 14:06.210
intelligent and diligent,

14:06.210 --> 14:07.810
even if we cultivated together,

14:07.810 --> 14:09.900
I remain stuck at the horned dragon rank,
unable to break through,

14:09.900 --> 14:11.570
while you have successfully
passed another tribulation.

14:11.570 --> 14:12.180
This is

14:12.490 --> 14:14.490
unprecedented for an Azure Dragon.

14:14.810 --> 14:17.140
Is there anything above the Azure Dragon?

14:19.940 --> 14:21.260
You may not remember your past,

14:21.260 --> 14:23.090
but your personality hasn't changed a bit.

14:23.090 --> 14:25.970
Legend has it that above the Azure Dragon
is the Holy Dragon.

14:25.970 --> 14:27.660
If you truly become a Holy Dragon,

14:27.660 --> 14:29.140
you can join the ranks of immortals

14:29.140 --> 14:30.020
and

14:30.020 --> 14:32.020
no longer walk in this mortal world.

14:32.020 --> 14:33.900
Would you really be willing to leave?

14:33.900 --> 14:37.090
So you're saying I'm now the top.

14:38.310 --> 14:39.320
Of course.

14:40.570 --> 14:41.480
Under heaven,

14:41.540 --> 14:44.200
there's probably no demon
who can match you now.

14:44.540 --> 14:45.700
Besides you,

14:45.890 --> 14:47.180
there's probably no one

14:47.180 --> 14:49.580
who could take
the position of Dragon Lord.

15:00.450 --> 15:02.110
Who is the current Demon King?

15:03.780 --> 15:05.560
There are many demon tribes,

15:05.610 --> 15:06.630
ruled separately

15:06.660 --> 15:07.610
with little connection to each other.

15:07.610 --> 15:09.140
Whoever claims to be king

15:09.260 --> 15:11.540
will surely face attacks
from other clans.

15:11.540 --> 15:12.580
This is why

15:12.610 --> 15:13.850
the more powerful the demons become,

15:13.850 --> 15:15.310
the more conflicts arise.

15:16.490 --> 15:18.020
The demons are too strong.

15:18.040 --> 15:20.440
Even if some clans
call someone Demon King,

15:20.490 --> 15:21.260
deep down

15:21.420 --> 15:22.950
they don't truly accept it.

15:23.850 --> 15:25.020
The supreme position

15:25.020 --> 15:26.350
is not easy to maintain.

15:26.450 --> 15:28.780
If you truly wish
to become the Demon King,

15:29.210 --> 15:31.210
it would take considerable effort.

15:31.210 --> 15:32.090
No, no, no.

15:32.090 --> 15:33.090
That's not what I meant.

15:33.090 --> 15:33.570
I was

15:33.730 --> 15:34.540
just asking.

15:34.690 --> 15:35.810
Now that you've
successfully passed the tribulation,

15:35.810 --> 15:36.380
tell me

15:36.420 --> 15:37.780
what gift you'd like.

15:40.420 --> 15:41.010
Mortal.

15:41.420 --> 15:42.050
Mortal?

15:42.660 --> 15:43.570
A human.

15:44.970 --> 15:46.300
So you want a slave?

15:47.210 --> 15:48.170
That's easy.

15:48.260 --> 15:48.940
If you want one,

15:48.940 --> 15:49.670
not just one,

15:49.850 --> 15:51.850
I can get you hundreds or thousands.

15:57.940 --> 15:58.810
Everyone, look!

15:58.810 --> 15:59.330
Is this...

15:59.330 --> 16:01.190
Is this an annular solar eclipse?

16:01.540 --> 16:02.810
I've only heard about it,

16:02.810 --> 16:04.160
so it really does exist.

16:05.690 --> 16:07.490
I've only heard about it before.

16:08.110 --> 16:09.110
That makes sense.

16:09.380 --> 16:10.090
This celestial phenomenon

16:10.090 --> 16:12.420
marks the emergence of
a divine guardian beast.

16:12.420 --> 16:13.970
It signifies that your identity
as the Azure Dragon

16:13.970 --> 16:15.630
is recognized by the heavens.

16:16.780 --> 16:18.780
This eclipse happened because of me?

16:18.780 --> 16:19.380
Yes.

16:19.690 --> 16:20.810
After successfully
passing the tribulation,

16:20.810 --> 16:22.570
special celestial phenomena occur.

16:22.570 --> 16:24.300
Before, we've seen
landslides and tsunamis.

16:24.300 --> 16:25.330
This annular solar eclipse

16:25.330 --> 16:26.860
has never been seen before.

16:29.140 --> 16:30.270
And shooting stars!

16:31.660 --> 16:32.920
That's the Ao Hen Clan.

16:32.970 --> 16:34.180
With the solar eclipse,

16:34.180 --> 16:36.140
many demons
who rely on sunlight for cultivation

16:36.140 --> 16:37.940
will have their power weakened.

16:38.380 --> 16:39.330
It seems Ao Hen

16:39.420 --> 16:41.750
is taking advantage of this opportunity.

16:42.130 --> 16:44.540
What's the relationship
between Ao Hen and the dragon clan?

16:44.540 --> 16:46.420
Ao Hen usually keeps to themselves,

16:46.420 --> 16:47.380
having no interaction

16:47.380 --> 16:48.710
with other demon clans.

16:50.690 --> 16:51.820
I'll go check it out.

17:10.339 --> 17:12.369
Sun God!

17:12.690 --> 17:14.869
We serve you with devotion!

17:15.339 --> 17:18.020
Please bless us, Sun God!

17:19.619 --> 17:21.540
The sunlight dims,

17:21.690 --> 17:24.260
and the Qiong Qi Clan will soon perish!

17:24.490 --> 17:26.450
A great calamity approaches!

17:27.420 --> 17:31.610
Please bless us, Sun God!

17:33.690 --> 17:37.690
Please bless us, Sun God!

17:37.820 --> 17:41.650
Please bless us, Sun God!

17:41.940 --> 17:45.580
Please bless us, Sun God!

17:45.620 --> 17:47.150
With such a disaster today,

17:47.620 --> 17:49.220
why are you still kowtowing?

17:50.290 --> 17:51.660
Our clan is exceptional,

17:51.660 --> 17:52.850
envied by many.

17:53.730 --> 17:57.590
Today we must guard against
demons taking advantage of our weakness.

18:17.660 --> 18:18.570
So it's you.

18:18.770 --> 18:21.100
I won't disappoint you
at a time like this.

18:22.210 --> 18:24.180
You like to challenge others, don't you?

18:24.180 --> 18:25.980
Then accept my challenge today,

18:26.050 --> 18:28.110
and let fate decide who lives or dies.

18:32.490 --> 18:33.950
You treacherous villain!

18:34.660 --> 18:36.190
Even with the sun obscured,

18:36.820 --> 18:38.420
I'll still beat you to a pulp!

19:45.100 --> 19:47.010
The annular solar eclipse is fleeting.

19:47.010 --> 19:48.470
A once-in-a-millennium opportunity

19:48.470 --> 19:49.400
can't be missed.

19:57.010 --> 19:58.250
So even 10,000 years ago,

19:58.250 --> 19:59.910
Ao Hen was just as detestable.

20:00.770 --> 20:02.900
It's time to teach you a proper lesson.

20:12.100 --> 20:13.210
Taking advantage of others' weakness,

20:13.210 --> 20:14.540
have you no shame at all?

20:17.490 --> 20:19.820
The dragon clan actually
has an Azure Dragon now.

20:19.820 --> 20:20.880
Congratulations.

20:21.620 --> 20:23.970
It seems this eclipse is happening
because of you.

20:23.970 --> 20:24.970
I should thank you

20:25.380 --> 20:27.510
for creating this opportunity for me.

20:28.050 --> 20:29.450
Since it's because of me,

20:29.450 --> 20:30.660
I must correct

20:30.660 --> 20:33.390
your bad habit
of plundering in times of trouble.

20:34.290 --> 20:35.530
I've heard that dragons

20:35.530 --> 20:37.730
never meddle in other clans' disputes.

20:38.180 --> 20:40.380
If today the Qiong Qi Clan is destroyed,

20:40.420 --> 20:41.770
I'm just following heaven's will.

20:41.770 --> 20:42.740
Bullshit!

20:52.420 --> 20:54.480
This is the power of the Azure Dragon?

20:57.690 --> 21:00.180
The feeling of defeating
an ancient great demon

21:00.180 --> 21:01.960
is incredibly satisfying.

21:24.860 --> 21:26.520
Blessed by Sun God,

21:27.210 --> 21:28.300
today's grudge

21:28.690 --> 21:29.950
will be avenged today!

21:41.020 --> 21:41.910
Back and forth,

21:42.050 --> 21:44.110
your revenge has already been taken.

21:48.340 --> 21:49.530
I stopped you once

21:49.560 --> 21:50.960
and stopped him once too.

21:51.050 --> 21:52.310
If you don't leave now,

21:52.530 --> 21:54.330
I can only follow heaven's will.

21:56.010 --> 21:56.860
Qiong Qi,

21:58.380 --> 21:59.730
you won't always be

21:59.730 --> 22:00.730
as lucky as today.

22:04.250 --> 22:04.820
Come back!

22:04.820 --> 22:05.350
Alright.

22:06.860 --> 22:08.690
He's already failed,
going for wool and coming home shorn.

22:08.690 --> 22:09.690
Stop chasing him.

22:10.010 --> 22:12.140
What's the point of all this fighting?

22:12.860 --> 22:15.060
How can I, Qiong Qi, be compared to wool?

22:15.490 --> 22:16.380
Yes.

22:16.380 --> 22:18.010
You're powerful, not wool.

22:18.970 --> 22:20.170
You're a great demon.

22:21.100 --> 22:21.830
Great demon.

22:29.770 --> 22:31.440
I never expected the Azure Dragon's power

22:31.440 --> 22:32.700
to be so overwhelming.

22:33.210 --> 22:34.470
From now on, this world

22:34.580 --> 22:36.710
will likely belong to the dragon clan.

22:42.490 --> 22:44.860
Thank you, Azure Dragon, for saving us!

22:47.250 --> 22:48.590
It was nothing.

22:48.660 --> 22:49.730
Besides, this solar eclipse

22:49.730 --> 22:50.900
was caused by me.

22:50.900 --> 22:52.100
Everyone, get up.

22:53.450 --> 22:54.510
Every tribulation

22:54.770 --> 22:56.420
comes with natural disasters.

22:56.420 --> 22:57.750
Fortune or misfortune,

22:57.860 --> 22:59.180
heaven decides each fate.

22:59.180 --> 22:59.710
Xiao Yao,

23:00.250 --> 23:01.580
although you've transformed
into the Azure Dragon,

23:01.580 --> 23:02.770
you shouldn't take

23:02.770 --> 23:04.660
all responsibilities upon yourself.

23:04.660 --> 23:05.320
Otherwise,

23:05.340 --> 23:06.660
wouldn't you be needlessly

23:06.660 --> 23:08.190
bearing many karmic debts?

23:08.690 --> 23:09.890
Everyone, disperse.

23:18.100 --> 23:18.660
Xiao Yao,

23:19.530 --> 23:22.180
I've watched
your daily cultivation progress,

23:22.180 --> 23:22.800
and now

23:23.210 --> 23:24.690
you've finally
transformed into the Azure Dragon.

23:24.690 --> 23:25.150
This...

23:26.970 --> 23:28.290
is truly moving.

23:32.140 --> 23:34.080
Have we known each other for long?

23:35.660 --> 23:37.290
I watched you grow up!

23:40.290 --> 23:41.750
You're like a big brother.

23:44.530 --> 23:47.330
I've forgotten many things
after my tribulation.

23:47.380 --> 23:48.980
Could you tell me about them?

23:49.140 --> 23:49.660
Sure.

23:51.210 --> 23:52.810
What did you just sa? Bull...

23:53.250 --> 23:54.110
Bullshit.

23:54.580 --> 23:55.040
Bull...

23:56.420 --> 23:57.870
That's vulgar language!

23:58.140 --> 23:59.530
You never used to speak like that.

23:59.530 --> 24:00.930
Who did you learn it from?

24:01.140 --> 24:02.480
Do I need to learn it?

24:04.290 --> 24:05.520
Before was one thing,

24:05.940 --> 24:07.620
but now you've become the Azure Dragon,

24:07.620 --> 24:09.750
the greatest Demon King under heaven.

24:09.860 --> 24:11.120
The words may be crude,

24:11.140 --> 24:13.170
but saying them makes me feel good.

24:13.900 --> 24:16.580
But you still need
to consider your status.

24:16.940 --> 24:17.940
Look at your power.

24:17.940 --> 24:19.860
You now surpass all other demons.

24:20.100 --> 24:21.820
If you can't reason with someone,

24:21.820 --> 24:23.350
just defeat them directly.

24:23.420 --> 24:24.950
Why use such crude language

24:25.340 --> 24:26.600
-to degrade...
-Fine.

24:26.660 --> 24:28.410
I won't say it in front of you anymore.

24:28.410 --> 24:30.670
I have matters to attend to. I'm leaving.

24:30.700 --> 24:32.830
Didn't you want to hear about the past?

24:33.430 --> 24:34.290
Let me tell you.

24:37.180 --> 24:38.290
Our Qiong Qi Clan,

24:38.730 --> 24:40.620
though born with
great strength and courage,

24:40.620 --> 24:42.150
also has fatal weaknesses.

24:42.690 --> 24:44.470
So I issued challenges everywhere

24:44.470 --> 24:46.400
to keep others from disturbing us.

24:46.970 --> 24:48.050
But I never expected

24:48.050 --> 24:49.340
that my fighting nature

24:49.340 --> 24:50.800
would be exploited by you.

24:51.580 --> 24:52.490
Back then

24:52.860 --> 24:54.460
you were just a Water Dragon,

24:54.620 --> 24:56.420
-always...
-About... this big?

24:56.820 --> 24:57.680
About this big.

24:58.250 --> 24:59.770
Always meddling in injustices.

24:59.770 --> 25:00.860
If there was nothing to meddle with,

25:00.860 --> 25:02.660
you'd create trouble yourself.

25:03.380 --> 25:04.440
Remember that time

25:04.620 --> 25:06.620
you stole from
the Treasure Swallower's Treasury?

25:06.620 --> 25:08.250
Then the little Treasure Swallower
discovered you

25:08.250 --> 25:09.570
and chased after you.

25:09.690 --> 25:10.890
You ran straight to me

25:11.010 --> 25:11.680
and told me

25:11.900 --> 25:12.770
that the little Treasure Swallower

25:12.770 --> 25:14.690
wanted to lock you up in their Treasury.

25:14.690 --> 25:16.100
Then you told
the little Treasure Swallower

25:16.100 --> 25:17.500
that I had sent you there.

25:17.860 --> 25:19.290
Ended up with me
and that Treasure Swallower

25:19.290 --> 25:20.590
fighting fiercely,

25:20.620 --> 25:21.580
while you

25:21.690 --> 25:23.490
ran off to sunbathe by the sea.

25:26.250 --> 25:27.090
Right here.

25:27.450 --> 25:28.110
Right here.

25:28.530 --> 25:31.190
I kicked him all the way
over there with one foot.

25:43.620 --> 25:44.150
Xiao Yao.

25:47.340 --> 25:48.140
Let's fight.

25:52.010 --> 25:52.940
Among us demons,

25:53.860 --> 25:55.460
the strong command respect.

25:57.820 --> 25:58.750
If I win,

25:59.770 --> 26:00.700
you belong to me.

26:01.580 --> 26:02.440
If I lose,

26:04.140 --> 26:05.000
I belong to you.

26:07.730 --> 26:09.200
Why?

26:10.530 --> 26:12.690
That's a win-win for you.

26:12.970 --> 26:13.890
Besides,

26:14.010 --> 26:15.250
I'm the Azure Dragon now.

26:15.250 --> 26:16.660
Aren't I the most powerful?

26:16.660 --> 26:18.110
Can you even defeat me?

26:18.290 --> 26:19.620
Your power may be great,

26:20.100 --> 26:21.770
but your experience is far less than mine.

26:21.770 --> 26:23.590
But I don't want to beat you.

26:24.140 --> 26:26.470
And I definitely
don't want to lose to you.

26:28.100 --> 26:29.430
For thousands of years,

26:30.730 --> 26:32.930
my feelings for you have never changed.

26:33.180 --> 26:34.910
But you always call me Brother.

26:35.820 --> 26:38.220
I couldn't express
my true feelings to you.

26:38.360 --> 26:39.110
No need.

26:39.210 --> 26:41.140
So I made resolutions again and again.

26:41.140 --> 26:42.600
I remember the first time.

26:42.860 --> 26:45.340
I wanted to wait
until you became a horned dragon.

26:45.340 --> 26:46.390
But when I saw you,

26:46.770 --> 26:48.540
I couldn't say a word.

26:49.970 --> 26:50.900
Later I thought,

26:51.690 --> 26:53.580
I'd wait until you became a winged dragon.

26:53.580 --> 26:53.980
But...

26:55.210 --> 26:56.530
But I still held back.

26:56.860 --> 26:58.090
Keep holding back then.

26:58.090 --> 26:59.550
I can't hold back anymore!

27:00.620 --> 27:02.150
You're now an Azure Dragon.

27:02.620 --> 27:03.970
I'm afraid if I don't tell you now,

27:03.970 --> 27:05.770
I'll never have another chance!

27:06.970 --> 27:07.900
I don't even know

27:07.900 --> 27:09.620
what resolution to make anymore!

27:09.620 --> 27:10.270
Xiao Yao,

27:11.050 --> 27:13.210
I just want to stay by your side forever.

27:13.210 --> 27:13.860
I just...

27:14.970 --> 27:17.420
Isn't the Azure Dragon
supposed to protect all living beings?

27:17.420 --> 27:18.760
How could I fight?

27:22.940 --> 27:23.660
Right?

27:26.970 --> 27:28.830
Think about when you were little.

27:28.860 --> 27:29.210
I...

27:29.230 --> 27:30.180
When you were little,

27:30.180 --> 27:31.050
didn't you have many

27:31.050 --> 27:31.900
questions you didn't understand

27:31.900 --> 27:32.900
and came to ask me?

27:33.450 --> 27:35.350
You can't remember anything now.

27:35.620 --> 27:38.100
Protecting all living beings
is a heavy responsibility.

27:38.100 --> 27:39.820
You need a demon like me by your side

27:39.820 --> 27:40.620
to advise you.

27:40.820 --> 27:41.250
I...

27:41.620 --> 27:42.620
Let's just fight.

27:44.250 --> 27:46.180
But I'll set the rules.

27:46.620 --> 27:47.250
If you win,

27:47.250 --> 27:48.770
I'll fight with you once a month.

27:48.770 --> 27:49.660
If you lose,

27:49.730 --> 27:51.860
I'll pretend I didn't hear anything today,

27:51.860 --> 27:53.390
and don't bring it up again.

27:54.940 --> 27:55.450
No?

27:56.250 --> 27:56.860
I'm leaving.

27:56.860 --> 27:57.390
Xiao Yao!

28:00.730 --> 28:01.390
I'll fight.

28:29.180 --> 28:31.780
I never thought
the gap between us was so great.

28:34.180 --> 28:36.380
It's only right that you look down on me.

28:37.100 --> 28:39.080
I didn't mean it that way.

28:44.070 --> 28:45.130
That fight just now

28:45.450 --> 28:46.310
made me realize

28:47.580 --> 28:49.510
what my next resolution should be.

28:49.860 --> 28:50.670
Before,

28:51.380 --> 28:52.330
I was arrogant.

28:54.530 --> 28:56.660
The only one worthy of the Azure Dragon

28:58.970 --> 29:00.030
is the Demon King.

29:01.560 --> 29:03.960
From now on,
I'll challenge you every year.

29:04.100 --> 29:05.100
When I defeat you,

29:05.420 --> 29:05.950
I believe

29:06.290 --> 29:07.290
that the demons

29:07.420 --> 29:09.580
will acknowledge
my position as Demon King.

29:09.580 --> 29:11.700
Only the Demon King

29:11.940 --> 29:13.290
is worthy of the Azure Dragon.

29:13.290 --> 29:16.620
This guy might be the real tribulation
I have to overcome.

29:17.770 --> 29:19.140
Hong Ye...

29:19.140 --> 29:21.450
When will you ever become the Demon King?

29:21.530 --> 29:24.040
Will I even live to see that day?

29:24.210 --> 29:25.340
Only the Demon King.

29:26.770 --> 29:28.010
Only the Demon King.

29:28.620 --> 29:30.280
We weren't finished talking.

29:31.180 --> 29:32.050
Tell me,

29:32.090 --> 29:34.220
what connection do I have with humans?

29:34.900 --> 29:36.020
You are a dragon.

29:36.620 --> 29:39.350
How could you have
any connection with servants?

29:41.530 --> 29:43.290
Humans have extremely short lives

29:43.290 --> 29:44.770
and barely any power or cultivation.

29:44.770 --> 29:45.900
They are the most

29:46.340 --> 29:47.580
lowly clan under heaven.

29:47.580 --> 29:49.580
Even capturing them
as servants is a bother

29:49.580 --> 29:50.980
because they're so dull.

29:51.180 --> 29:53.110
They're hardly worth mentioning.

29:54.690 --> 29:55.340
Sister?

29:58.820 --> 30:00.080
Did you guess it was me?

30:01.580 --> 30:02.450
Of course.

30:03.730 --> 30:05.110
I'm back!

30:07.490 --> 30:09.610
What magnificent golden armor.

30:09.900 --> 30:11.690
I knew you'd succeed in your tribulation,

30:11.690 --> 30:13.430
just didn't expect it so soon.

30:14.620 --> 30:16.250
Xiao Yao is now an Azure Dragon.

30:16.250 --> 30:18.000
Stop calling her Sister.

30:18.130 --> 30:19.790
At least call her Dragon Lord.

30:20.620 --> 30:21.290
You're so

30:21.420 --> 30:22.640
rigid and boring.

30:22.690 --> 30:24.250
No wonder Sister
always wants to avoid you.

30:24.250 --> 30:25.390
I'm not like that.

30:25.580 --> 30:26.750
I like Sister,

30:26.900 --> 30:28.860
and I don't care if she's an Azure Dragon

30:28.860 --> 30:29.720
or Dragon Lord.

30:29.770 --> 30:30.050
You...

30:30.050 --> 30:30.910
Right, Sister?

30:34.900 --> 30:35.400
Sister,

30:35.490 --> 30:36.360
did you get any

30:36.420 --> 30:39.350
congratulatory gifts
for passing the tribulation?

30:41.620 --> 30:43.590
No gifts prepared?

30:44.820 --> 30:46.790
I was worried I'd be late.

30:47.010 --> 30:47.490
Unexpectedly,

30:47.490 --> 30:48.980
the timing is perfect.

30:52.870 --> 30:54.670
Freshly out of the tribulation!

30:54.770 --> 30:56.430
She can't remember anything!

30:56.530 --> 30:59.190
Probably doesn't recall
your childish tricks.

31:01.290 --> 31:02.100
That's...

31:02.860 --> 31:04.270
even better.

31:04.940 --> 31:06.730
Even though it's the same trick,

31:06.730 --> 31:08.290
you will still find it fresh.

31:08.290 --> 31:09.120
The same thing

31:09.180 --> 31:10.970
can make you happy over and over again.

31:10.970 --> 31:11.830
How wonderful.

31:12.100 --> 31:12.960
Right, Sister?

31:13.900 --> 31:14.900
That makes sense.

31:17.050 --> 31:18.090
But, Sister,

31:18.380 --> 31:20.180
do you really remember nothing?

31:22.730 --> 31:24.970
Not a single thing?

31:25.860 --> 31:26.520
Watch this!

31:37.420 --> 31:37.820
See?

31:37.820 --> 31:39.480
You remember this, don't you?

31:39.580 --> 31:40.400
Isn't this...

31:40.610 --> 31:42.340
something we're born knowing?

31:42.900 --> 31:44.890
I can do this up to 20

31:45.010 --> 31:45.720
or more.

31:46.210 --> 31:46.900
20?

31:48.290 --> 31:49.220
Never mind that.

31:49.250 --> 31:50.820
Come with me to see your gift.

31:50.820 --> 31:52.950
I've been preparing it for a long time.

31:55.900 --> 31:56.620
Let's go together.

31:56.620 --> 31:57.770
I still need to cultivate.

31:57.770 --> 31:58.770
Right.

31:58.770 --> 31:59.620
Let's go, Sister.

31:59.620 --> 32:00.900
Don't disturb his cultivation.

32:00.900 --> 32:01.430
Let's go.

32:01.900 --> 32:02.430
Let's go.

32:02.490 --> 32:02.950
Xiao...

32:05.860 --> 32:06.520
Protect...

32:06.820 --> 32:08.350
Protect all living beings!

32:09.050 --> 32:09.850
That time,

32:09.900 --> 32:11.560
I encountered the Chaos Clan.

32:11.770 --> 32:13.340
My power wasn't strong enough then,

32:13.340 --> 32:14.670
so I could only run away.

32:14.770 --> 32:16.190
When I was beaten,

32:16.340 --> 32:17.970
I would silently count in my head.

32:17.970 --> 32:18.970
I thought to myself,

32:18.970 --> 32:21.140
if I could survive 500 strikes,

32:21.140 --> 32:22.940
that would be quite remarkable.

32:23.690 --> 32:24.620
Just then,

32:25.050 --> 32:27.600
I heard someone else counting too,

32:27.660 --> 32:29.210
shouting while counting,

32:30.730 --> 32:32.690
"I dare you to beat me to death!

32:32.970 --> 32:34.520
Once I take 500 strikes,

32:34.580 --> 32:35.770
I'll transform into a winged dragon

32:35.770 --> 32:37.780
and fight you all!"

32:38.900 --> 32:40.290
I was out of strength,

32:40.380 --> 32:41.530
but hearing that voice,

32:41.530 --> 32:43.130
I was suddenly full of energy

32:43.210 --> 32:45.380
and escaped immediately.

32:45.860 --> 32:46.730
That person

32:47.340 --> 32:48.860
was...

32:48.860 --> 32:49.580
Me?

32:50.010 --> 32:50.450
Yes.

32:50.730 --> 32:51.460
Since then,

32:51.530 --> 32:53.100
you've always been by my side,

32:53.100 --> 32:54.820
eating, drinking, and having fun together.

32:54.820 --> 32:56.690
No matter how strange my ideas were,

32:56.690 --> 32:58.490
you could always understand me.

32:59.620 --> 33:00.950
For thousands of years,

33:01.180 --> 33:02.510
in all heaven and earth,

33:03.180 --> 33:04.760
you're my only true friend,

33:05.530 --> 33:06.890
the only one I can share

33:06.970 --> 33:08.010
my heart with.

33:13.620 --> 33:14.150
This

33:14.490 --> 33:15.340
is the gift.

33:21.620 --> 33:23.530
This is Lantern Grass from Mount Kunlun.

33:23.530 --> 33:25.050
It blooms once every thousand years,

33:25.050 --> 33:25.620
and

33:25.770 --> 33:27.240
only for an instant.

33:27.690 --> 33:30.050
I had to use all my persuasive powers

33:30.050 --> 33:31.900
to convince it to come down with me.

33:31.900 --> 33:32.410
Sister,

33:32.730 --> 33:33.820
don't blink.

33:38.580 --> 33:39.330
Wake up.

33:41.590 --> 33:43.520
The sister I told you about is here.

33:44.290 --> 33:46.110
It's time to bloom.

34:17.219 --> 34:17.790
Xiao Yao.

34:19.900 --> 34:21.739
I've called you sister for 1,000 years,

34:21.739 --> 34:22.600
afraid that you

34:23.340 --> 34:25.480
truly only see yourself as my sister.

34:26.780 --> 34:27.380
Tonight,

34:27.650 --> 34:28.850
I bare my heart to you.

34:29.219 --> 34:30.350
Would you be willing

34:31.050 --> 34:32.250
to become my partner?

34:39.489 --> 34:40.150
Teng She,

34:40.820 --> 34:41.780
I cannot accept.

34:42.699 --> 34:44.760
My heart already belongs to someone.

34:50.350 --> 34:50.860
This is

34:52.090 --> 34:52.900
the

34:52.900 --> 34:55.389
999th time you've rejected me.

34:55.650 --> 34:58.780
I thought you forgot everything
after the tribulation.

35:01.900 --> 35:02.570
I'm sorry.

35:08.740 --> 35:10.070
I wasn't being serious.

35:10.170 --> 35:12.100
Why are you taking it so seriously?

35:13.340 --> 35:14.060
Confirmed.

35:14.340 --> 35:14.820
You're

35:15.490 --> 35:16.890
still the same as before.

35:18.010 --> 35:19.270
It's just that before,

35:20.380 --> 35:22.380
you never mentioned liking anyone.

35:25.220 --> 35:26.110
From now on,

35:26.420 --> 35:28.530
we can still be friends, right?

35:29.610 --> 35:30.970
If I find more

35:30.970 --> 35:33.260
rare, delicious, or interesting things,

35:33.260 --> 35:34.010
can I still

35:34.010 --> 35:35.340
share it with you?

35:38.340 --> 35:38.820
Call me.

35:41.940 --> 35:42.490
Sister.

35:47.260 --> 35:47.710
Good.

35:48.300 --> 35:49.780
If you have anything
tasty or fun in the future,

35:49.780 --> 35:51.180
don't you hide it from me.

35:52.780 --> 35:53.220
Mm.

35:55.970 --> 35:56.570
It's just

35:56.570 --> 35:57.900
a shame about this gift.

35:57.940 --> 35:59.540
I spent so long preparing it.

36:01.050 --> 36:02.050
This Azure Dragon

36:02.050 --> 36:03.450
is really hard to please.

36:07.740 --> 36:08.500
Never mind.

36:08.820 --> 36:10.420
The person who won your heart

36:10.570 --> 36:13.030
must be someone
far more impressive than me.

36:13.530 --> 36:15.150
Don't tell me who he is.

36:16.530 --> 36:17.050
I...

36:18.490 --> 36:19.550
don't want to know.

36:25.740 --> 36:27.090
You want to go home?

36:31.380 --> 36:32.050
Sister,

36:32.900 --> 36:33.420
I need to

36:33.420 --> 36:35.480
take it back to Mount Kunlun quickly.

36:36.380 --> 36:37.380
Goodbye, Sister.

36:46.530 --> 36:47.740
I gave you a chance to run.

36:47.740 --> 36:49.000
Why are you still here?

36:49.050 --> 36:50.850
Haven't you been beaten enough?

37:00.350 --> 37:02.480
The Azure Dragon is truly remarkable.

37:02.940 --> 37:05.600
Impressive how well
you've hidden your breath.

37:05.650 --> 37:06.740
You may fool Teng She,

37:06.740 --> 37:07.940
but you can't fool me.

37:08.780 --> 37:10.780
Let me warn you on behalf of Teng She.

37:11.260 --> 37:13.340
If you tell anyone about
what happened today,

37:13.340 --> 37:14.340
you'll regret it.

37:15.820 --> 37:17.860
Qiong Qi and Teng She are so lucky

37:18.610 --> 37:19.300
to have a good friend

37:19.300 --> 37:21.160
and to have backed the right side.

37:21.300 --> 37:22.900
You're now the Azure Dragon.

37:23.170 --> 37:24.370
Why don't you kill me?

37:25.740 --> 37:26.970
Why should I kill you?

37:28.820 --> 37:29.490
All demon clans

37:29.490 --> 37:32.090
have been fighting each other
for 1,000 years.

37:32.130 --> 37:34.190
Especially for great demons like us,

37:34.490 --> 37:36.220
cultivation is extremely difficult.

37:36.220 --> 37:37.590
Even without grudges,

37:37.820 --> 37:39.900
demons still fight to steal others' power

37:39.900 --> 37:41.240
for their own gain.

37:41.530 --> 37:43.530
My power didn't come from stealing.

37:44.380 --> 37:46.040
But now you have this ability.

37:46.740 --> 37:48.130
Why not take this shortcut?

37:48.130 --> 37:49.790
What kind of shortcut is that?

37:50.090 --> 37:51.160
You steal from him,

37:51.180 --> 37:52.860
then another great demon steals from you.

37:52.860 --> 37:54.040
If no one focuses on cultivation

37:54.040 --> 37:55.490
and everyone just
keeps stealing from each other,

37:55.490 --> 37:56.490
what happens when

37:56.650 --> 37:57.860
there's nothing left to steal?

37:57.860 --> 37:59.060
What will you do then?

38:01.700 --> 38:02.900
Without inner peace,

38:03.090 --> 38:04.450
nothing can be achieved.

38:04.450 --> 38:06.180
I know a powerful great demon.

38:06.340 --> 38:07.900
He protects the demons in Demons' Valley,

38:07.900 --> 38:09.380
which is a heavy responsibility,

38:09.380 --> 38:12.170
yet he still practices cultivation
diligently every day.

38:12.170 --> 38:13.090
For him,

38:13.650 --> 38:14.420
cultivation

38:14.780 --> 38:16.780
is also about cultivating the mind.

38:18.200 --> 38:19.600
Where is Demons' Valley?

38:23.090 --> 38:23.970
Demons' Valley

38:24.420 --> 38:25.650
is a land of peace

38:27.130 --> 38:28.480
where the demons

38:28.570 --> 38:29.900
live together in peace.

38:31.570 --> 38:33.220
Relying solely on self-cultivation,

38:33.220 --> 38:35.550
when will one
become the best in the world?

38:37.420 --> 38:38.450
I am the Azure Dragon.

38:38.450 --> 38:39.960
I am the best in the world.

38:40.010 --> 38:41.530
With me around,
you'll never be number one.

38:41.530 --> 38:42.860
What can you do about it?

38:45.490 --> 38:47.820
Cultivation is about balance and change.

38:48.860 --> 38:50.790
No one should boast about forever.

38:53.780 --> 38:55.340
I just love seeing you unable

38:55.340 --> 38:57.000
to out-argue or out-fight me.

39:22.090 --> 39:22.860
It's getting late.

39:22.860 --> 39:23.700
Get some rest.

39:25.820 --> 39:27.620
Cultivation is a lifelong journey.

39:27.620 --> 39:30.080
You probably won't
figure it out right away.

39:30.220 --> 39:30.780
Just

39:31.130 --> 39:32.930
don't stray onto the wrong path.

39:34.610 --> 39:35.490
Xiao Yao,

39:35.740 --> 39:36.870
are you still there?

39:38.170 --> 39:39.220
Hide your breath first.

39:39.220 --> 39:40.550
Come out after we leave.

39:40.610 --> 39:40.970
Mm.

39:43.260 --> 39:44.010
I'm here!

39:44.780 --> 39:45.420
Xiao Yao.

39:47.050 --> 39:47.940
Teng She has had enough fun,

39:47.940 --> 39:49.140
and I let him go ahead.

39:49.300 --> 39:49.820
Hurry.

39:49.820 --> 39:50.860
-I have something to ask you.
-Back then, I...

39:50.860 --> 39:51.740
Come on. Let's go.

39:51.740 --> 39:52.700
-I just...
-Go.

39:52.970 --> 39:54.120
Go, keep going.

39:54.220 --> 39:55.260
Come on.

39:55.260 --> 39:55.820
Don't trip me up.

39:55.820 --> 39:57.020
Hurry, move forward.

40:15.170 --> 40:16.450
Since the Azure Dragon's emergence,

40:16.450 --> 40:17.530
the weather has become favorable,

40:17.530 --> 40:19.090
and the land has been peaceful.

40:19.090 --> 40:21.340
There have been fewer conflicts
among the demons as well.

40:21.340 --> 40:24.090
Everyone seems to settle down
and focus on their cultivation.

40:24.090 --> 40:25.620
We should really thank you.

40:27.300 --> 40:29.300
If the world could remain like this,

40:29.300 --> 40:30.260
I would be content.

40:30.260 --> 40:31.740
You will live as long as heaven and earth,

40:31.740 --> 40:33.940
so things will naturally stay this way.

40:35.490 --> 40:36.220
Dragon Lord!

40:37.130 --> 40:37.860
Dragon Lord.

40:41.420 --> 40:42.530
Greetings, Dragon Lord.

40:42.530 --> 40:44.970
Little dragon, why are you so reckless?

40:46.050 --> 40:47.070
My name is Long Yu.

40:46.630 --> 40:47.940
[Long Yu]

40:47.260 --> 40:48.170
Don't call me little dragon.

40:48.170 --> 40:49.900
You're clearly just a scaled dragon,

40:49.900 --> 40:51.420
not yet transformed into a true dragon.

40:51.420 --> 40:52.860
How can you use the surname "Long"?

40:52.860 --> 40:54.560
I'm only half a level away.

40:54.940 --> 40:56.340
With the Dragon Lord as my guiding light,

40:56.340 --> 40:57.800
it's just a matter of time.

40:58.130 --> 40:59.450
With that ambition of yours,

40:59.450 --> 41:01.510
I don't mind you using the name early.

41:02.610 --> 41:03.540
Tell me quickly,

41:03.700 --> 41:04.700
what's the matter?

41:04.700 --> 41:07.100
The Dragon Lord's birthday is coming soon.

41:07.450 --> 41:08.420
My birthday?

41:08.490 --> 41:09.010
Yes.

41:09.300 --> 41:09.900
This is

41:09.900 --> 41:12.220
your first birthday
since becoming the Azure Dragon.

41:12.220 --> 41:13.340
We must celebrate it grandly.

41:13.340 --> 41:15.470
A grand celebration isn't necessary.

41:15.930 --> 41:17.960
If there must be something special,

41:18.010 --> 41:20.070
I'd like to have a bowl of noodle soup.

41:22.010 --> 41:23.530
What is noodle soup?

41:28.650 --> 41:30.030
So in this era,

41:30.130 --> 41:32.130
noodles haven't been invented yet.

41:47.820 --> 41:49.330
My wish is

41:50.010 --> 41:51.490
to see Hong Ye again.
